# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Licence signing material. NEVER commit any of this.
#
# The private key is the entire basis of the licensing system: anyone holding
# it can issue licences the application will accept, and losing it means every
# licence ever issued has to be reissued under a new key. Keep it in a password
# manager or an offline backup, never in source control.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.key
licence-private.key
license-private.key
*.pfx
*.snk
